        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/c5a1d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-13T09:14:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm currently awaiting my copy of Infernal Relics from FedEx, and I'm already thinking about whether or not I want to get Rook City. However, I think I would only want to get it if I could get a printing with the updated wording. Is there an updated version of Rook City, or would I have to reference the errata document when using it?</p>",
