        "id": 40062,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-13T15:06:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm pretty sure they still have Rook City boxes from their initial print run earlier this year (and haven't needed a so make any further printing yet), thus a box ordered today would be identical to a box ordered at lauch.&nbsp; That said, I don't believe there have been any cards neededing rewording (maybe one card, but I can't remember), and they have the same design and quality as the Enhanced Edition and Infernal Relics (in fact, it was the design and quality of Rook City that had them make Enhanced Edition the way they did).</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:13:45.945Z",
