        "created_at": "2012-10-13T16:09:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are several misprints in Rook City, but I don't think there's currently plans to \"enhance\" rook city with updated cards that fix printing/editing errors. I didn't think there were any erratas for Rook city though...</p>",
